# Gmsh native mesh - regenerable from .geo, .inp is the consumed artifact
*.msh

# Large regenerable FEA intermediates/results - regenerate via:
#   gmsh <case>.geo -3 -o mesh_raw.inp -format inp   (mesh)
#   ccx analysis                                      (solve, produces .frd/.dat)
# Reproducibility comes from the tracked .geo/.inp files + scripts,
# not from committing multi-hundred-MB binary results.
*_raw.inp
mesh_hex.inp
*_clean.inp
mesh_clean.inp
gmsh_log.txt
*.frd
*.dat

# Debugging/environment-troubleshooting artifacts (not part of the pipeline)
resource_log.txt
# Stage 5 Netgen full-mesh .inp files - large (6-27MB each) and fully
# regenerable via scripts/mesh_netgen_level1_v2.py [1|2|3]. Only the
# final accepted L3 result is tracked as the reproducibility artifact.
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/stage5_netgen_L1_solve.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/stage5_netgen_L2_solve.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/stage5_netgen_solve.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/stage5_netgen_level2_solve.inp

# Dead-end Jacobian-investigation .inp files (Gmsh-era, superseded by
# the Netgen pipeline) - investigation is documented in README.md
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/full_model_no_coupling_test.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/neighbor_patch_test.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/neighbor_patch_test_v2.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/single_element_test.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/stage5_level1_LINEAR_TEMP_solve.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/stage5_level1_v3_solve.inp
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/stage5_level1_v3_solve_ITERATIVE.inp
# Stage 6 parametric mesh .inp files - large (avg ~33MB, 766MB total
# across 22 designs) and fully regenerable via
# scripts/mesh_stage6_design.py from the committed .brep files,
# lhs_design_points.csv, and the fixed L3 sizing scheme. Only the
# .brep geometry, scripts, and results CSVs are tracked; mesh .inp
# files are treated as reproducible intermediates, same precedent
# as Stage 5's excluded L1/L2 .inp files.
01-aerospace-mounting-bracket/simulation/stage6_parametric/*.inp
